-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- 3. Section 9: Detector null-space
-- A population-deviation detector returns false (zero signal) whenever an individual's reading
-- matches the population mean/mode. Any universal trained binding sits in its exact null space.
DetectorBlindAt : {P O : Type} → (P → O) → O → (P → Bool) → Type
DetectorBlindAt {P} {O} o mean det = (x : P) → o x ≡ mean → det x ≡ false
